<title>USA: U.S. cotton exports by class -- Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. cotton exports by class -- Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department cotton exports by class (running bales):</p>
<p> -		 Total  Upland-A  Upland-B  Upland-C   Am.Pima</p>
<p> -  Aug 96    245,388   80,047   111,469    45,734     8,138</p>
<p> - July 96    175,911   37,428   102,962    26,650     8,872</p>
<p> -  Aug 95    300,785   25,424   207,294    63,012     5,055</p>
<p>A-Under 1 inch. B-1 inch to 1-1/8 inches. C-1-1/8 inches or more.</p>
</text>
